# (선택 — 데이터 스펙의 'KR 일 1회 시총·가격 갱신' 채택 시에만 설치) KRX 일별 가격·시총 + 오프라인 PER/PBR 재계산.
[Unit]
Description=AI-Investment-Bot KR daily price/market-cap refresh
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target
OnFailure=quant-alert@kr-refresh.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=ubuntu
WorkingDirectory=/home/ubuntu/AI-Investment-Bot
Environment=PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
Environment=QUANT_BOT_DB_PATH=/home/ubuntu/AI-Investment-Bot/data/universe_replica.db
Environment=QUANT_BOT_CACHE=off
Environment=QUANT_BOT_SYNC_TIMEOUT=300
ExecStart=/usr/bin/flock -w 300 /home/ubuntu/AI-Investment-Bot/data/.universe.lock /home/ubuntu/AI-Investment-Bot/.venv/bin/python scripts/build_universe.py --discover --markets KR
TimeoutStartSec=1200
Nice=10
MemoryMax=600M
OOMScoreAdjust=300
